ne.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;MEL1hHqju4q5l6n47Ts7uPaxRuC_DfBqvslvPLxc_PAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky.The manuscript carries a material factual inversion in paragraph 2 â€” reporting the domestic opening as "approximately $117 million" when witnessed sources establish $124.5 million as the actual result and $117 million as the studio's pre-release projection that was exceeded. Two additional defects are bounded: the complete absence of ## section headings despite the commission spec requiring three to five, and a near-duplicate sentence pattern in paragraph 4 flagged by deterministic copy-edit standards. All three defects are repairable without replay.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lBWxQsHN--QZbpLytsWBf7gGQkm-1tMp-YnqK4AiQnUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwsubmit_revision_requestƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;dARxUwW0SRGva1W_gVGYj7pk9kIt8jkNmp0cFSKRf1Iƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgsuccessƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NhJv4X33rjpsi8pyEGf7Vl3mocqBJnCvQSD8pz6I1uAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkicompletedƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;GWGcLVUoIzQTY0qfW4N-1HUGaxIdWmK4tmWO5BHtC1Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkc244ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ZlSuhhThkuqzdu79qjvVlGVgYG82dGUNlUxdKXDGwrYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkh0.611051ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EmI8WMDT55W08N-V773lTkS1_BMjj49vkd5f6lmb2Egƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkf215338ƒdpairƒhcons